                                                "sense_id": "dec68b79-cb4c-3c4d-ae61-96135f887dae",
                                                "text": "Oh, what a perfect thought. Lilies-of-the-valley, and white pansies, double white violets and white velvet ribbon… From an unknown friend. … From one who understands. … For a Little Girl."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
